OL,3,GNEWSAAlcohol delivery apps 'played
OL,4,Apart' in man's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man who died of alcohol
OL,7,Fabuse aged 33 is calling for
OL,8,Frestrictions on the amount of booze
OL,9,Fthat can be bought on food delivery
OL,10,Fapps.
OL,12,FAnissa Khalfa said her cousin Tom
OL,13,FGreest, who died in March 2025, often
OL,14,Fhad alcohol delivered two or three
OL,15,Ftimes a day and before his death, 60
OL,16,Fwine bottles were found at his home.
OL,18,FThe 18-year-old, from Jarrow, in South
OL,19,FTyneside, said the rapid delivery apps
OL,20,Fplayed a part in his death and called
OL,21,Ffor restrictions.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
