OL,5,
OL,6,FTom often used UberEats and a spokesman
OL,7,Ffor the company said: "The safety and
OL,8,Fwellbeing of our community is our
OL,9,Fpriority and we are deeply committed to
OL,10,Fresponsible alcohol delivery."
